one xml:id="m-94716da5-e999-4621-89dd-9543526a2722" ulx="42" uly="1444" lrx="469" lry="1481" /><zone xml:id="m-eede8854-c02c-4f42-ae9b-e765ec5f7465" ulx="514" uly="1466" lrx="877" lry="1506" /><zone xml:id="m-56cbef3c-1948-4ee0-b7d8-b9ddda0ae2bc" ulx="43" uly="1476" lrx="467" lry="1511" /><zone xml:id="m-6ff1706d-6218-4812-9a56-2c61bed7b018" ulx="42" uly="1497" lrx="235" lry="1536" /><zone xml:id="m-10494fc2-8045-4eb7-bbb7-06063b5e2ba2" ulx="511" uly="1497" lrx="717" lry="1537" /></surface></facsimile><body>
    <mdiv type="solesmes">
      <score>
        <section>
          <pb xml:id="m-b306b566-9842-4934-88f2-82111ce52731" n="0333" facs="#m-290b5f5f-3c0e-40ec-930d-45a47e47c87d" /><div xml:id="m-97663d32-a76c-4828-8362-eeae3d1164c7">
            <lg xml:id="m-ebe7f33f-5d12-4cf3-988a-edaf23ee5e41">
              <l xml:id="m-783fe23c-3aeb-4a5a-963a-e692256890b7" facs="#m-ff2b8d55-33d5-4798-95ac-f7de3a50acd4" label="text-like">LAUDS OF FEASTS.</l><l xml:id="m-095a84ee-0f1b-4aa2-94ac-78b0ece13e52" facs="#m-e2364750-3238-41a4-93b2-00a199ef2a17" label="lyrics-like">V. Déus m adjutórium. 250.</l><l xml:id="m-958bd4ad-a872-471d-9f57-a4ceff8ff914" facs="#m-e12e8360-687e-4181-a833-7eb09ef6ed57" label="text-like">The Psalms and the Canticle are then said in the following order, with</l><l xml:id="m-9096fc99-e8b0-4516-9c99-0cfb1782e9e0" facs="#m-7ab5651a-5271-435f-b007-e164f1e8a287" label="text-like">the five Antiphons indicated at the Proper of the Feast:</l><l xml:id="m-4225bc8d-2af4-4d1e-a1a9-4ca69ccb6b76" facs="#m-469df064-517e-4fb2-b227-075f5c67c535" label="lyrics-like">Laudáte nómen éjus: quóniam</l><l xml:id="m-34b200ee-ba21-4811-bc90-d34c9962bdb8" facs="#m-619e64d9-ebe8-46bc-9ae0-e830edad8182" label="text-like">First Antiphon.</l><l xml:id="m-2a1fef1e-1bdd-4c04-99d5-681c74d69e97" facs="#m-5ebe7100-f4c9-48c7-b2c5-c4333b35042a" label="lyrics-like">suávis est Dóminus, t in aëtérnum</l><l xml:id="m-1371387e-4b97-4b48-be13-52d16ce09b1a" facs="#m-de1c14c3-f501-4e91-a450-8358ef31c4bb" label="ambiguous">Psalm 92.</l><l xml:id="m-50402949-bb83-48a4-89b2-46323ef157fd" facs="#m-833eadc1-e2c3-4fb3-a297-09bc18817f3b" label="lyrics-like">misericórdia éjus,* et usque in ge¬</l><l xml:id="m-80b0f8df-701d-4ebc-aad1-99da9628c421" facs="#m-1ece6112-2aa7-45cf-8a5a-b14396a38bdc" label="lyrics-like">neratiónem et generatiónem véri¬</l><l xml:id="m-f59373c7-ef3b-4849-b594-cc89f6966939" facs="#m-380c091f-dcdb-4e45-85b7-65496df7d528" label="lyrics-like">Ominus regnávit, decórem in¬</l><l xml:id="m-27b6b8a6-1858-4ccf-84c1-228216e95ba1" facs="#m-6a0d9939-69d6-4536-8782-9e6ad03bf69e" label="lyrics-like">D dutus est :* indútus est Dómi¬</l><l xml:id="m-6efbf641-d146-49f2-a536-ce8303a46d79" facs="#m-b3686d6a-d081-4282-8777-9604c51eb832" label="lyrics-like">tas éjus.</l><l xml:id="m-1d60e4fb-b539-4b22-8995-2ace1aa65f02" facs="#m-43ae15b2-ee09-4090-97ca-d40d024f5097" label="text-like">The second Antiphon is repeated.</l><l xml:id="m-ff90943d-5632-4772-a2a4-4b8c394c6676" facs="#m-6233417d-5be1-4cd5-897b-8aa9b933a474" label="lyrics-like">nus fortitúdinem, et praeeinxit se.</l><l xml:id="m-5346b988-6df2-4398-a24e-1bdcafba4f34" facs="#m-64b4ac52-2e70-4b54-a16e-23e330be9445" label="lyrics-like">Etenim firmávit órbem térrae,</l><l xml:id="m-c9a49be8-c545-4b4d-a2b9-9a705bda110a" facs="#m-2b7bad80-9d64-4f80-aeb0-86791f7e52bf" label="text-like">Third Antiphon.</l><l xml:id="m-7942a147-b714-45d4-92a5-8667c583dcaf" facs="#m-14f40109-795d-4bef-9af8-73088a9a17e2" label="lyrics-like">qui non commovébitur.</l><l xml:id="m-64209b15-6087-4075-bbdc-38312d38eec9" facs="#m-64e44ecf-d5df-4a1e-b76e-cc6844c30301" label="ambiguous">Psalm 62.</l><l xml:id="m-09f869e7-4459-450f-8314-2ed8a3186992" facs="#m-908d910e-dcb3-4472-a56e-37ea8e365df9" label="lyrics-like">Paráta sédes túa ex tunc:*a</l><l xml:id="m-a02f7eaa-0a85-4a6f-8363-c10c78d76a9d" facs="#m-fa0bbb6f-71b9-4127-8f9f-8f80e454fa53" label="lyrics-like">Eus, Déus méus, * ad te de lúce</l><l xml:id="m-f3425a2e-5202-4178-953c-6412450fad15" facs="#m-56d715ce-8b43-46df-b107-1dc6de37e893" label="lyrics-like">saéculo tú es.</l><l xml:id="m-04bcbc04-db70-4f8c-ba56-1bb8c540be17" facs="#m-5a3a49b1-2a1b-4dc9-8066-af30bf1eef56" label="ambiguous">D vigilo.</l><l xml:id="m-5fc4e277-9e9b-4ccf-9adc-3ff126678323" facs="#m-50417609-b662-4208-9a43-53971f04ab5b" label="lyrics-like">Elevavérunt flúmina, Dómine,</l><l xml:id="m-474779d0-349e-4479-b834-b897ccdad3f3" facs="#m-27074767-1d48-4f98-b735-f1b3670733f0" label="lyrics-like">Sitivit in te ánima méa,“quam</l><l xml:id="m-2eeee272-ab8e-472a-bc82-606a8a0c9347" facs="#m-ed60668d-3ab5-41ec-b242-57f068d6e1cf" label="lyrics-like">elevavérunt flúmina vócem súam.</l><l xml:id="m-f70f3927-85b7-4c04-a94f-f014537c6e31" facs="#m-dd5fc204-79c8-4585-b2ce-699cddbb9c26" label="lyrics-like">multipliciter tibi cáro méa!</l><l xml:id="m-9c9d4370-b62e-477b-a128-7a4c69c77ff3" facs="#m-4252e7fe-4896-4501-98b2-d485a88f52ba" label="lyrics-like">Elevavérunt flúmina fuctus sú¬</l><l xml:id="m-92158833-81e5-4ad4-a8a7-4d9cde116d35" facs="#m-0074c8dc-586e-4789-8e40-0f308946b056" label="lyrics-like">In térra desérta et invia et ina¬</l><l xml:id="m-353d1619-39a4-4c24-b326-4528b9898e5b" facs="#m-782fc296-2cd4-4e45-af95-af22832dcb65" label="lyrics-like">os, * a vócibus aquárum multárum.</l><l xml:id="m-97850fd3-a5bf-4f91-b6b3-9e372c908f2f" facs="#m-21ef177c-285e-4815-b252-8e69c93ff2f6" label="lyrics-like">quósa : t sic in sáncto appárui tibi,</l><l xml:id="m-4220358a-6242-422d-bc5a-3cb0dbe0e4fe" facs="#m-098eb0d1-aa70-407c-bc23-2f7f1706208a" label="lyrics-like">Mirábiles elatiónes máris: * mi¬</l><l xml:id="m-1d090a8d-ef93-4397-af84-139a8044833c" facs="#m-5ef87357-8250-4e22-a5aa-4311e1ad7072" label="lyrics-like">rábilis in áltis Dóminus.</l><l xml:id="m-6a4d7dd0-2730-47e2-8b26-6234b12606ad" facs="#m-97bbf317-59ef-4ee9-a7b3-2959f18d9f07" label="lyrics-like">ut vidérem virtútem túam et gló¬</l><l xml:id="m-21b57739-7ead-4cd5-ae10-21766e754e94" facs="#m-c57a3196-7723-48cc-9723-2897a457f43e" label="lyrics-like">riam túam.</l><l xml:id="m-6e64c3b7-a255-4093-b478-e288c5eeb773" facs="#m-d0813219-49e8-4611-8fde-9aff64c52d9f" label="lyrics-like">Testimónia túa credibilia fácta</l><l xml:id="m-f18a0f16-6d38-4962-ab23-0d1ab41d7671" facs="#m-1e455d3e-5ff6-4989-81ce-c1e251e9d703" label="lyrics-like">Quóniam mélior est misericórdia</l><l xml:id="m-e115573e-9ae2-4220-9b48-c58f32bb6cb8" facs="#m-d0ecbe0f-6f26-4247-bc9c-b2fb4da583df" label="lyrics-like">sunt nimis :* dómum túam décet</l><l xml:id="m-f425ffbe-1842-44ea-9d33-398a5f1a4be8" facs="#m-c379038f-9b10-4c49-851a-fdb860672cb8" label="lyrics-like">sanctitúdo, Dómine, in longitúdi¬</l><l xml:id="m-257000b7-6c74-4954-a991-6c9eb8947c98" facs="#m-b903996c-743a-43ec-a699-bc99bb5ec70e" label="lyrics-like">túa súper vitas:“ábia méa lau¬</l><l xml:id="m-94acf4e7-870a-4bcc-a416-9c7c9d2dfa17" facs="#m-a7a2524e-3bfb-42e5-b06e-e8a93d9b7dc3" label="lyrics-like">nem diérum.</l><l xml:id="m-1989b28c-f712-4b3c-a6c0-d759cc4bc4e6" facs="#m-5721c58d-9156-4448-8ca8-f8a07edc75c7" label="lyrics-like">dábunt te.</l><l xml:id="m-e58dd20c-4a43-4f2c-8070-5f8f1856ed69" facs="#m-ebd02e33-f373-4da0-87f3-fee3dd533085" label="lyrics-like">Sic benedicam te in vita méa:"</l><l xml:id="m-9a9e623e-592f-4eb3-b825-508f71a14aca" facs="#m-7b8db4a3-4774-4382-835b-265e44bec7eb" label="lyrics-like">Glória Pátri, et Filio, * et Spiri¬</l><l xml:id="m-70ff2bf5-3b81-4c58-acab-fcf3c153e60b" facs="#m-f62c1d43-2302-45a6-ac12-c48c14cdebb7" label="lyrics-like">et in nómine túo levábo mánus</l><l xml:id="m-898c10d4-461b-403f-b852-a2e1acc1d7a1" facs="#m-9c3c91f9-3e92-449b-9c9d-1f44bfbdcc31" label="ambiguous">tui Sancto.</l><l xml:id="m-b5c5a3b4-a795-4d48-b6ab-fffa950a03fd" facs="#m-00aa4a05-d824-49c9-92be-502c63ed61ad" label="lyrics-like">Sicut érat in principio, et núne,</l><l xml:id="m-7abae5c1-8224-4803-9dd0-d2ccf5b9d359" facs="#m-0c5ac7fe-cc8e-4684-b364-2a7414d218ef" label="lyrics-like">méas.</l><l xml:id="m-eb5a69c6-3aeb-493c-974e-0d8c39a79b19" facs="#m-d25a1e9f-901a-4213-837b-bba670e4340d" label="lyrics-like">Sicut ádipe et pinguédine repleá¬</l><l xml:id="m-e45548c9-32b4-4962-b0f8-9996146128f5" facs="#m-53b82082-de7e-4a65-9104-a43257adbb62" label="lyrics-like">et sémper, * et in saécula saeculó¬</l><l xml:id="m-456df826-829c-4586-82d8-7eaccc5489c6" facs="#m-fda3feb6-7219-4622-8b73-eee9b4dbcc61" label="lyrics-like">tur ánima méa :* et lábiis exsulta¬</l><l xml:id="m-c42d6b46-db60-4c7f-97c9-a2fdebd8a197" facs="#m-9a55b618-37c7-432a-928b-22ffcc7f2cac" label="ambiguous">rum. Amen.</l><l xml:id="m-7e0a0650-e004-4a3d-8db2-d4ca10724ea9" facs="#m-e40d5e61-fb73-4596-a4eb-72d578025712" label="lyrics-like">tiónis laudábit os méum.</l><l xml:id="m-932e4073-fed4-4904-9107-d931136840b3" facs="#m-9e16eeae-5226-4627-b323-429fc239dbff" label="text-like">All the Psalms and Canticles end</l><l xml:id="m-075f4d97-0f7d-4509-ba26-3ddb57dd89ee" facs="#m-007ea1e0-d98e-4ddb-abc6-5d53d2a2917f" label="lyrics-like">Si mémor fúi túi super strátum</l><l xml:id="m-973bddbb-e9b7-4deb-a648-a413ffc14165" facs="#m-ab546f15-089e-484c-b0c9-1a0a8bffc60e" label="lyrics-like">thus with the doxotogy Glória Pátri.</l><l xml:id="m-69cc227e-2d98-4493-a94b-69de0c7f8599" facs="#m-a1f17a0b-b525-4742-90de-866c135b4e68" label="lyrics-like">méum, t in matutínis meditábor in</l><l xml:id="m-b8e5d7e2-d0e4-4a74-8cff-c4076957f563" facs="#m-206fad7c-5625-4861-8823-9fb136574fe9" label="text-like">antess the contrary be indicated.</l><l xml:id="m-6912872a-c3e3-4173-8af5-871679a28f92" facs="#m-b334227b-43e7-43d3-ab85-fbfd69e4c4fe" label="lyrics-like">te:* quia fuisti adjútor méus.</l><l xml:id="m-28f05dac-14ed-4972-92a8-d60a5ec7b970" facs="#m-c7bf7e19-93d0-4a20-b4b0-a451cdd18364" label="text-like">The first Antiphon is repeated.</l><l xml:id="m-69463f21-f446-4569-9a83-f9588bdb1ba3" facs="#m-d47bf513-3951-45f7-b69e-b47023e88e94" label="lyrics-like">Et in velaménto alárum tuárum</l><l xml:id="m-92d2e347-80aa-4e41-b386-355d5236243e" facs="#m-40de6b54-308b-4bbb-b261-0048b70eeb6e" label="text-like">Second Antiphon.</l><l xml:id="m-a484ca5d-efd2-4f6e-b83a-9fc5035326d7" facs="#m-84cafab1-cd91-4d3e-908c-21322754828b" label="lyrics-like">exsultábo, t adhaésit ánima méa</l><l xml:id="m-78060e94-2e3a-46c8-8d9c-100768b819eb" facs="#m-f8cecd07-5d1d-4410-bf2b-2c5df125b48f" label="lyrics-like">post te:“me suscépit déxtera</l><l xml:id="m-8fc10bad-9817-4a2f-973b-f1b862505860" facs="#m-97f44a87-3f55-4679-bec9-0522acf0f08e" label="ambiguous">Psalm 99.</l><l xml:id="m-96413c85-38fe-4899-a3c5-9430594bd4c9" facs="#m-e6290129-2bc0-4faa-8ca8-314683188478" label="ambiguous">tua.</l><l xml:id="m-07c2b4ef-1339-427a-b7b2-57daba17420a" facs="#m-39409d22-2878-410d-a69d-861a68530964" label="lyrics-like">(Ubiláte Déo ómnis térra :* ser¬</l><l xml:id="m-d6499b27-ac62-4547-821a-91cf6f483efd" facs="#m-ee39164f-a171-4925-bf44-def30182da7d" label="lyrics-like">Ipsi vero in vánum quaesiérunt</l><l xml:id="m-58c58dbf-c727-4ef2-9129-6e5c0d5c6cdf" facs="#m-2d0ea430-b3c3-444b-a84d-0c025f9552de" label="lyrics-like">O vite Dómino in lactitia.</l><l xml:id="m-12f03d09-443a-42dd-a189-7ed21c70499a" facs="#m-12737570-a35a-47de-be79-d8c5066e7642" label="lyrics-like">ánimam méam, t introibunt in infe¬</l><l xml:id="m-cae1cd57-d4c9-4d19-82b5-4a5ebc9131e2" facs="#m-1642fa18-af74-4b97-817d-7892a47bc883" label="lyrics-like">Introite in conspéctu éjus, * in</l><l xml:id="m-d99b258b-c5f5-4eb4-8428-c11605b3bb5d" facs="#m-eee02cbd-6d37-4e9c-b298-509f124575d8" label="lyrics-like">rióra térrae :* tradéntur in mánus</l><l xml:id="m-5ab5071f-6555-46de-af5f-9ab9e38eb3fd" facs="#m-bc031778-1407-4551-8948-afd63ef02f48" label="lyrics-like">exsultatióne.</l><l xml:id="m-a1ddbc81-c953-4d74-9b6a-4631c5234ede" facs="#m-55fb8aed-9cb3-43aa-9363-a1685c9f0aee" label="lyrics-like">gládii, pártes vulpium érunt.</l><l xml:id="m-be5eae53-fdef-4121-b9fe-3c961fde6dfc" facs="#m-a0d55b84-0705-426d-a51d-437ada883a1f" label="lyrics-like">Scitóte quóniam Dóminus ipse</l><l xml:id="m-fa364850-d729-4bfd-981e-2da1c114206f" facs="#m-38a2b927-d813-4676-9865-44dd7e3d0d22" label="lyrics-like">Rex vero laetábitur in Déo,</l><l xml:id="m-8b01a095-9e9d-4dde-91d8-40513e907e0c" facs="#m-8e859633-9f79-4499-a28d-15c8673e5a1d" label="lyrics-like">est Déus : * ipse fécit nos, et non</l><l xml:id="m-f9e57bcc-e751-4af9-9e5d-27259518a696" facs="#m-5f56177d-0a58-4e00-9017-c08c7f17c0dd" label="lyrics-like">laudabúntur ômnes qui júrant in</l><l xml:id="m-371cec82-7c91-4dbf-9d28-136d006b3738" facs="#m-1fae1725-e2f7-41d3-ad57-150596fc0524" label="ambiguous">ipsi nos.</l><l xml:id="m-74f2ed38-78e2-42e6-869e-01ac0e4bc5aa" facs="#m-b67e6c62-daeb-4a03-87a3-498176f1d8a1" label="lyrics-like">*quia obstrúctum est os lo¬</l><l xml:id="m-1cd4e090-bf05-405c-b361-f8420c942fb8" facs="#m-4da8237d-4ebb-4e41-a18b-9aba8d31d6fd" label="lyrics-like">Pópulus éjus, et óves páscuae</l><l xml:id="m-d4bfce8a-a56a-4dc9-a0f4-bb2ebecf40d3" facs="#m-55aad1dd-0b94-4304-88a8-82bd9ff562ec" label="lyrics-like">quéntium iniqua.</l><l xml:id="m-3bbe46d3-3376-4807-8ecc-73022f35a272" facs="#m-94716da5-e999-4621-89dd-9543526a2722" label="lyrics-like">éjus : t introîte pórtas éjus in con¬</l><l xml:id="m-d3333851-612f-48b2-9c88-96b0e330f0d4" facs="#m-eede8854-c02c-4f42-ae9b-e765ec5f7465" label="text-like">The third Antiphon is repeated.</l><l xml:id="m-6b7e23a6-4e12-45c2-a649-d46a9c366861" facs="#m-56cbef3c-1948-4ee0-b7d8-b9ddda0ae2bc" label="lyrics-like">fessióne, * átria éjus in hymnis</l><l xml:id="m-34fa84c2-14a9-48e4-92bc-c49ee46f3238" facs="#m-6ff1706d-6218-4812-9a56-2c61bed7b018" label="lyrics-like">confitémini illi.</l><l xml:id="m-f7abc30f-decb-4797-8f51-f1068a228568" facs="#m-10494fc2-8045-4eb7-bbb7-06063b5e2ba2" label="text-like">Fourth Antiphon.</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
</mei>